CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication (3D Models, Shaders & Audio Assets)
==============================================================================

All Wavefront 3D models (`assets/models/*.obj`), GLSL post-processing shaders
(`assets/shaders/*.frag`), vector icons (`assets/icon/*.svg`), procedural 64x64
material textures, and procedurally synthesized 16-bit 44.1 kHz WAV soundtracks
included in EchoLabyrinth are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
